{"id":"n71958-1-7","stage":3,"title":"응급실 · 急诊室","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71958-1-7-1","ko":"아기가 갑자기 먹은 걸 토하고 몸에서 열이 나요.","zh":"宝宝突然吐出了吃下去的东西，而且身上还有发烧症状。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아기가","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹은","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"토하고","meaning":"呕吐","explanation":"토하다：呕吐；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"토하다","audio":"/audio/ebede831c778366b736f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49300","senseId":"1","lemma":"토하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몸에서","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"열이","meaning":"热，烧","explanation":"열：热，烧；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"열","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67807","senseId":"1","lemma":"열","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나요.","meaning":"发，闹","explanation":"나다：发，闹；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"20","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"ebede831c778366b","term":"토하다","zh":"呕吐","audio":"/audio/ebede831c778366b736f.mp3","entryId":"49300","definition":"把服下去的食物吐出来。","pronunciation":["토ː하다"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"6f4112362e973dd6","term":"열","zh":"热，烧","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3","entryId":"67807","definition":"生病是在体内产生的热气。","pronunciation":["열"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发，闹","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"身体上产生某种现象或生病。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9ee510be133cd8692543.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71958-1-7-2","ko":"얼른 병원 응급실로 가 보세요.","zh":"请尽快带他去医院的急诊室。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얼른","meaning":"快地","explanation":"얼른：快地","readings":[{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67315","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"병원","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"응급실로","meaning":"急诊室，急救中心","explanation":"응급실：急诊室，急救中心；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"응급실","audio":"/audio/6fa7ab0d739213b2915b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71958","senseId":"1","lemma":"응급실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보세요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d658f46882498576","term":"얼른","zh":"快地","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3","entryId":"67315","definition":"不拖延时间就。","pronunciation":["얼른"]},{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"6fa7ab0d739213b2","term":"응급실","zh":"急诊室，急救中心","audio":"/audio/6fa7ab0d739213b2915b.mp3","entryId":"71958","definition":"医院里设有可以对患者进行急救处理的设施的房间。","pronunciation":["응ː급씰"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0327755ae0ed5215bac6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.937,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71958","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":101,"sequenceScore":2.6623,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["请尽快带他去医院的急诊室。","宝宝突然吐出了吃下去的东西，而且身上还有发烧症状。","你去医院是有什么事吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["宝宝突然吐出了吃下去的东西，而且身上还有发烧症状。","你去医院是有什么事吗？","请尽快带他去医院的急诊室。"],"answer":2}]}
